  "limits": [
    "Historical analyzer and ledger omit source/build fingerprints from cohort identity. This audit has not yet changed or superseded their outputs.",
    "The S2 baseline block0 and four later complete baseline blocks differ in foreground guard implementation and executable hashes. The initial S3 run used execution Xcode26.5 but its compile receipt is Xcode26.2. Its distinct foreground-guard source/executable cohort is the relevant difference.",
    "Before asserting original replication requirements met, split build cohorts in analyzer, ledger and report, preserving historical artifacts. Missing source proof must never create pooled matching replication.",
    "No local phone tests or new study execution performed by this host audit."
  ],
